👑🧠 Birbal and the True Beauty (Raw Story)

One day, Emperor Akbar asked his court, “Who is the most beautiful person in the world?”

Many courtiers praised the queen or other royal people.

Akbar then asked Birbal.

Birbal said, “The most beautiful person is one’s own child.”

Akbar was surprised.

Birbal explained, “Every parent thinks their child is the most beautiful, no matter how they look.”

To prove this, Birbal asked a man to bring his child to the court.

The child was not very good-looking.

But the father said proudly, “My child is the most beautiful in the world!”

Akbar smiled and understood.

💖 Moral:

Beauty lies in the eyes of the beholder.
